flowchart TD
    A[Agent proposes an action] --> B{Required fields valid?}
    B -- No --> M[MANUAL_REVIEW]
    B -- Yes --> C{Action type supported?}
    C -- No --> M
    C -- Yes --> D{Read-only or internal draft?}
    D -- Yes --> E[ALLOW within scoped policy]
    D -- No --> F[REQUIRE_APPROVAL]
    E --> G[Return decision and reasons]
    F --> G
    M --> G
    G --> H[No action is executed by this evaluator]
